	(text "Operating voltage is currently 25 VRMS.  With +/-80VDC bus, 50 VRMS\nis about the max the driver can support, but distortion increases \nabove 35V or so. 200 Ohm will give about 100 mA for the\n3DCC08-A-0038J coil (~ 330 uH + 10 Ohms) at 25 VRMS. This would be\n100 mW dissipation in each axis (300 mW total). This part is not\ncharacterized as a source at all, so that may be on the high side.\nBut we can reduce the driver output as needed to avoid smoke."
